  "job_B2.2.9_20251003_114505": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode. BE OFERFYLLE. Ve qui consurgitis mane ad bibendum, et reliqua. Wa eow, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee lufia\u00f0 untidfylla & \u00e6r on morgen oferdrenc dreoga\u00f0 & beotlice l\u00e6ta\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ge Hearpe & pipe & mistlic gliggamen drema\u00f0 eow on beorsele; & ge Godes cr\u00e6fta nan \u00f0ing ne gyma\u00f0. And \u00f0y is folces forfaren ealles to wide mare \u00feonne scolde o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feearf w\u00e6re, & for\u00f0am hit wear\u00f0 swa Gyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsingodre \u00feeode. BE SWICDOME. Ve qui sapientes estis coram oculis uestris, et reliqua. Wa eow, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee talia\u00f0 eow sylfe to \u00f0eodwitan & witan \u00fe\u00e6t ge syndan \u00e6bere mannswican. Ge fylsta\u00f0 on unriht oftost wi\u00f0 sceatte & nella\u00f0 to rihte, butan man gebicge. Gyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsyngodre \u00feeode. BE UNRIHTWISNESSE. Ve qui dicitis bonum malum et malum, et reliqua. Wa eow, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fee talia\u00f0 ungod to gode & god \u00feing to yfele, biter \u00f0ing to swete & swete bel\u00e6\u00fea\u00f0, Gyt Isaias fur\u00f0or s\u00e6de ealswa hit aeode on forsingodre \u00feeode. BE ANDGYTLESTE. Audite audientes et nolite intellegere, et reliqua. Hlysta\u00f0 nu georne, he cw\u00e6\u00f0, & nyta\u00f0 na \u00f0e mare; locia\u00f0 brade & nan \u00feing gecnawa\u00f0 mid \u00e6nigean Gyt Isaias fur\u00f0",
